# A view of bytes may have more than 2^31 of them, so the index is compared with the length as a sign-extended word. The store takes that word, not another extension.
# RUN: emit f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: unit f1
# CHECK: = SExt32({{*}}, origin = 72)
# CHECK-NOT: = ZExt32({{*}}, origin = 72)
